OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween beats Christmas for
OL,4,Aspooky display pair
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo neighbours who team up to transform
OL,7,Ftheir homes into one big Halloween
OL,8,Fdisplay say they find the occasion more
OL,9,Fentertaining than Christmas.
OL,11,FEddie Wood, from Grimsby, has decorated
OL,12,Fhis house for 12 years, while neighbour
OL,13,FGay Hodgson followed suit about seven
OL,14,Fyears ago when she moved in next door.
OL,16,FVisitors are invited to explore the
OL,17,Fdisplay in return for a donation to
OL,18,FMacmillan Cancer Support.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
