OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween beats Christmas for
OL,4,Aspooky display pair
OL,5,
OL,6,FGay said: "When my daughter was young,
OL,7,FI used to always decorate the porch
OL,8,Fwhere we lived. And then when I moved
OL,9,Fhere, he [Eddie] definitely got me
OL,10,Fhooked on Halloween."
